<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="http://www.semanticweb.org/ADMO#"
     xml:base="http://www.semanticweb.org/ADMO"
     xmlns:DMO="http://www.semanticweb.org/DMO#"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:ADMO="http://www.semanticweb.org/ADMO#"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:NDDUO="http://scai.fraunhofer.de/NDDUO#">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ADMO">
        <rdfs:comment>Alzheimer Disease Map Ontology - ADMO

1. Copyright of ontology

The ontology was created jointly by the Aramis project-team (Inria, CNRS, Inserm, Sorbonne University, Institut du Cerveau et de la Moelle épinière) and the DYLISS project-team (Inria, CNRS, University of Rennes 1).
